{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not convert MDC snapshot failures into terminal workflow failures.** A transient/custom MDC adapter failure occurs before handler or plugin code runs, yet `finishFailure` records it as the durable execution result and prevents a clean invocation retry. Treat capture as best-effort with an empty baseline, or propagate a retryable invocation-level failure without producing a terminal output.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772REy","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":299,"observation_digest":"1c93c6c1eb96cbafea7072e5f2d080df3a3e6b602dde393e723360c9671219f8","observation_id":"aro_v1_dsj4nqpls3f272tqols7fuea34","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T23:52:38Z","review_id":"arr_v1_szk72x3mjnb5bveole7xlq3ka3","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"a14e96e22281887b621451a5488a88d7de1a49ff","reviewer":"codex","start_line":298,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_qrirf6nh4rrwktkpe27htgzaqb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T23:52:38Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
